# Lotka-Volterra 2d (singular Lagrangian) with Degenerate Variational Integrators

```julia
run_single(lotka_volterra_2d_iode(), :DVI1A, IntegratorDVIA, 10)
run_single(lotka_volterra_2d_iode(), :DVI1B, IntegratorDVIB, 10)
run_single(lotka_volterra_2d_iode(), :DGTDVI, IntegratorCTDVI)
run_single(lotka_volterra_2d_iode(), :DGMDVI, IntegratorCMDVI)
```
